OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court charged with
OL,4,Apossessing firearm after car hit by
OL,5,Agunshots
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,8,Fwith possessing a firearm after armed
OL,9,Fpolice responded to a "critical
OL,10,Fincident" involving a car being hit by
OL,11,Fgunshots.
OL,13,FDavid Joyce, 24, appeared at Swansea
OL,14,FMagistrates' Court and spoke only to
OL,15,Fconfirm his name, age and address of
OL,16,FBonymaen Road, Swansea.
OL,18,FSouth Wales Police said a vehicle
OL,19,Fsustained damage "consistent with a
OL,20,Ffirearms discharge" on Clase Road,
OL,21,FMorriston, Swansea, at 16:14 GMT on 6
OL,22,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
