OL,3,GNEWSAMan appears in court charged with
OL,4,Apossessing firearm after car hit by
OL,5,Agunshots
OL,6,
OL,7,FJoyce was arrested three days after the
OL,8,Fincident in Mansfield. He was remanded
OL,9,Fin custody and will next appear at
OL,10,FSwansea Crown Court on 14 December.
